  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>\\</p>\n<h1 id=\"atak---geofences---advanced-features\"><a href=\"#atak---geofences---advanced-features\">ATAK - Geofences - Advanced Features</a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"atak-connected-to-takserver---geofences\"><a href=\"#atak-connected-to-takserver---geofences\">ATAK connected to takserver - Geofences</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Monitor with Geofences",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Geofences help you to monitor movement &#x26; events in certain areas.</li>\n<li>Start by drawing an area shape using the Drawing Tools</li>\n<li>Then select and tap the Geofence icon.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/fdd6bca67f66f7ff.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Which change should alert us?",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tap the change selector to edit what change will alert us.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/cf66ed64a0387ce4.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Options on alerting",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Choose what suits your needs best.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f8dff3c7200bab31.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "What items will alert?",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>What-something that appears in the geofence area, will draw an alert? Choose as you need.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/945a62013c9d842f.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Options: Set & Send",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>In case you want to send your new Geofence, do so using the usual recipient dialog.</li>\n<li>You can send to a Feed. The feed will auto invite users that triggers the Geofence.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ca187847ce9848b9.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Review the Situation",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>From the main menu's Geofences tab, you can review all Fences in place.</li>\n<li>If the Geofences tab is not present in your menu, tap the yellow pen to find and activate it.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d755dc29a4557507.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "List Geofences",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You'll see the list of fences, their names and their status.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1d4c4647354a2937.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Alert!",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You'll get an alert of breach according to your configuration.</li>\n<li>List them in Geofences-> the fence in question.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3b610c296faea346.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Review Alerts of your Fence",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>List alerts in the fence view. Press the trash bin to delete or disable the alert.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3143b16ad62405e3.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Disable or Delete an Alert",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Choose and that's it!</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6b6f03778686f4ab.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You can close this guide.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
